            <ArticleTitle>Bone infarction as a cause of painful fingers in a child.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>477-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An unusual case of painful fingers in a two-year-old child is described. The possible aetiolgy is discussed. The condition normally runs a self-limiting course.</AbstractText>
